<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Yulon 1996 six-mth profits rise.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Yulon 1996 six-mth profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month results to June 30.</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover			   18,588    vs  16,938 (revised)</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			329    vs     213 (revised)</p>
<p>    Earnings per shr (single T$)   0.40    vs    0.15 (revised)</p>
<p>NOTE - Yulon Motor Co Ltd is one of Taiwan's three biggest carmakers. There was no immediate explanation why the figures were revised.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
